    "title": "Wet Nose Wednesday: Meet Virgo - NewsBreak",
    "text": "18 hours ago Virgo needs a home! This handsome guy is a German Shepherd mix. He is approximately three years old and 78 lbs. The Aiken County Animal Shelter has been taking in so many German Shepherds. Virgo was a stray, and he has done so well at the shelter. But shepherds truly struggle in kennels; they need a person to bond with, a yard to play in, and consistent care. Read full article\n3",
